category_count":2},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"Cajun/Creole, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"_C7QiQQc47AOEv4PE3Kong","name":"Commander's Palace","shared_categories":"Cajun/Creole, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants, Seafood","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Cajun/Creole, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Food, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"Food","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"4gu8bjsgJoZrilDr_u3pEg","review_id":"raRfmztgbBY7bous75bYxQ","date":"2016-09-10T20:28:27","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9396580457687378,"text_excerpt":"I stopped here yesterday. The food is rather tasty. I ordered the Wuzzam wings and the Sweet Heat wings with fries with ranch and cheese. Those fries were outstanding. I also ordered the pineapple lemonade, which was rather tasty. The Wuzzam wings had a tangy, spicy kick - I was told they are the number 1 pick. The sweet heat was a little bit sweet for my taste, but were good nonetheless. I am a big believer in supporting small business, so I definitely would be back. I heard the owner tell almost everyone leaving the place: \"Thank you for coming.\" In my eyes, that's a big deal."},{"business_id":"4gu8bjsgJoZrilDr_u3pEg","review_id":"2ZmDidCKns-_fHi--bcKww","date":"2018-08-18T14:31:06","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9307365417480469,"text_excerpt":"I had been following this place in Instagram and had it bookmarked as one of the spots I wanted to visit when I went I New Orleans. After touring the city we were hungry she was on Canal Street. Saw the sign and instantly recognized it as being on my to do list. Walked in there were a few people here but it wasn't crowded That was a big plus because Omega Psi Phi fraternity was in town and they were everywhere. We ordered our food. Dude at the counter was super helpful and patient as we did not know what we wanted. He was nice enough to make some suggestions and even gave us some samples of this drink they had. The wings and ranch fries are bomb!!! I have not one complaint. I could only e..."},{"business_id":"4gu8bjsgJoZrilDr_u3pEg","review_id":"H63B0eHNDCe_tmZ7wdRBCQ","date":"2016-12-21T09:04:21","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.928875744342804,"text_excerpt":"I found out about this place on IG and gave it a try. And....its a great spot. The Wuzzam wings are the item to get. The wings are well prepared and plenty of sauce on them. I can't complain about that. The price I might have a problem with. 25 for 20 wings and fries. I can get a 10 piece whole wing combo for 15 at a local wing spot at home. Great food and service. Price is iffy. I would go back."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"4gu8bjsgJoZrilDr_u3pEg","photo_id":"bN_Kvi9_zc3ym15YOLGA2g","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/bN_Kvi9_zc3ym15YOLGA2g.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9137508869171143},{"business_id":"4gu8bjsgJoZrilDr_u3pEg","photo_id":"CTjoZrYZ_YDhdaFgwYAtKw","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/CTjoZrYZ_YDhdaFgwYAtKw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9016769528388977},{"business_id":"4gu8bjsgJoZrilDr_u3pEg","photo_id":"-NmLZ11SkPmsd3qlMgxZ5Q","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/-NmLZ11SkPmsd3qlMgxZ5Q.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8749692440032959},{"business_id":"4gu8bjsgJoZrilDr_u3pEg","photo_id":"zsnMT8tdZW1KPqv8_Dkotw","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/zsnMT8tdZW1KPqv8